{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111549","id":2907406274,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6tS3_C","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111549","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111549.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111549.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111549","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111549/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111549/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111549/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b1e2958cb9623ff471bb8cda2f5eb900e3be6817","number":111549,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Editor: Add note icon for nodes with description in SceneTree","user":{"login":"blazejhanzel","id":29534847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NTM0ODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29534847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazejhanzel","html_url":"https://github.com/blazejhanzel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazejhanzel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazejhanzel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazejhanzel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazejhanzel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazejhanzel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazejhanzel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazejhanzel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazejhanzel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazejhanzel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Summary\r\n\r\nThis pull request adds a small note icon next to nodes that have a non-empty editor_description in the SceneTree.\r\n\r\nThe icon appears alongside other editor indicators (groups, signals, visibility).\r\nClicking the icon opens a text edit dialog allowing to view or modify the node’s description.\r\n\r\n### Usability\r\nIt helps developers quickly spot nodes with custom notes or comments, improving experience and readability when working with complex hierarchies.\r\n\r\nRequested here:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9950\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13336\r\n\r\n### Preview\r\n<img width=\"424\" height=\"245\" alt=\"Zrzut ekranu 2025-10-12 o 10 54 00\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a552dc7-a165-4b60-a2b8-1f920db03549\" />\r\n<img width=\"1525\" height=\"1005\" alt=\"Zrzut ekranu 2025-10-12 o 10 54 19\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f204335b-063b-4686-a551-38d98f7332d6\" />\r\n\r\n### Implementation details\r\n* Added new icon\r\n* Most of modifications are in scene_tree_editor.cpp to display the icon when editor_description is not empty\r\n* Clicking the icon opens a TextEditDialog for convenient note editing; This required to change open_big_text method to be public.\r\n\r\n### Testing steps\r\n1. Open any scene.\r\n2. Select a node and fill its Description field.\r\n3. Observe that a note icon appears next to the node in the SceneTree.\r\n4. Click the icon to open the note editor dialog.\r\n5. Clear the description → icon disappears.\r\nWorks also for subnodes but requires reloading scene, because it is not refreshed automatically.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis is my first PR to the project — feedback is very welcome!\r\nThank you 🙌\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:* Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9950","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","desc